SUMMARY:Joe Wong LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - Sacramento
DTSTAMP:20260805T111659Z
DTSTART:20260805T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nJoe Wong LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacra
	mento\nComedian Joe Wong brings his acclaimed stand-up to Punch Line Comed
	y Club in Sacramento on August 5\, 2026! Known for his deadpan delivery an
	d brilliantly crafted jokes\, Joe Wong is one of the most distinctive voic
	es in comedy today. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 5\, 2026\nTi
	me: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacra
	mento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 1
	8+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages pe
	r person \nAbout Joe Wong\nJoe Wong is a Chinese-American stand-up comedia
	n who rose to national fame with his appearances on The Late Show with Dav
	id Letterman and The Tonight Show. His unique blend of self-deprecating hu
	mor\, sharp wit\, and immigrant perspective has earned him a devoted follo
	wing and critical acclaim across the comedy world. \nWhat to Expect\n\nDea
	dpan stand-up comedy with brilliant joke construction\nUnique immigrant pe
	rspective and self-deprecating humor\nIntimate club setting at Sacramento’
	s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\nA memora
	ble night of intelligent\, hilarious comedy\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Li
	ne Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, C
	A. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full
	 bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lo
	t. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $32. This is an 18+ event with
	 a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmast
	er (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets
	\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purcha
	se tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are fina
	l. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
	\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/joe-wong-live-at-punch-line-comedy-cl
	ub-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/joe-wong-live-at-punch-line-comedy-clu
	b-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\
	, CA\, 95825
