DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets \nRogelio Ramos LIVE at Chicago Improv\nRogelio Ramos brings his hil
	arious Spanish-language stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaumbur
	g for a special En Español performance. One of Latin comedy’s biggest star
	s\, Ramos delivers high-energy\, relatable humor that resonates with audie
	nces across generations. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026
	\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors: 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfi
	eld Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID req
	uired)\nLanguage: En Español (Spanish-language performance)\nSeating: Gene
	ral Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink mini
	mum per person \nAbout Rogelio Ramos\nRogelio Ramos is one of the most pop
	ular Spanish-language stand-up comedians in the United States and Latin Am
	erica. Known for his energetic performances and sharp cultural observation
	s\, Ramos has built a massive following with his relatable humor about fam
	ily\, relationships\, and everyday life. His shows consistently sell out a
	cross the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy Spanish-language stand-
	up comedy\nHilarious cultural observations and family humor\nIntimate come
	dy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-item 
	minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nDoors open at 5:00 PM — arr
	ive early for best seats\n\nVenue Information\nChicago Improv is located i
	nside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of the premier comedy clubs 
	in the Chicago area. The venue offers a full menu and bar service in an in
	timate showroom setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Information\nTic
	kets start at $65.73. Available through Ticketmaster. All sales are final.
	 \nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commis
	sion if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nA
	ll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be re
	quired for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/rogelio-ramos-live-a
	t-chicago-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
