SUMMARY:Justin Martindale LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260805T111659Z
DTSTART:20260806T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nJustin M
	artindale is an LA-based comedian\, writer\, producer\, and actor who was 
	the last hand-picked paid regular at The World Famous Comedy Store by the 
	legendary Mitzi Shore herself. That distinction alone speaks volumes about
	 his talent and the respect he commands in the comedy world. \nJustin host
	ed the highly popular E! Entertainment bi-weekly digital series What the F
	ashion\, and can be heard on Radio Andy on Sirius XM. He is also the host 
	of his own weekly charting podcast Just Sayin’ with Justin Martindale. Whe
	n he’s not in high demand across multiple platforms\, Justin performs stan
	d-up all over the country. \nHis comedy is sharp\, witty\, and delivered w
	ith the kind of confidence that only comes from years of performing at the
	 highest levels of the industry. Justin’s shows are consistently entertain
	ing and leave audiences wanting more. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, 
	August 6\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM CDT\nVenue: L
	augh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 782
	16\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\n\nAbout the Venu
	e\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy des
	tination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco
	 — just inside the loop and only a few miles from the airport. \nThe club 
	features a full bar lounge where guests can grab a drink before the show\,
	 and a comfortable showroom with first-come\, first-served seating. Prefer
	red Tables are located center stage for the best views\, while General Adm
	ission tables are positioned on the sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item f
	ood or beverage minimum per person once seated\, and an 18% service charge
	 applies to all checks in the showroom. Early arrival is strongly recommen
	ded to secure your preferred seating. \nWhat to Expect\nJustin Martindale 
	brings the energy and polish of a Comedy Store veteran to the intimate set
	ting of Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club. His comedy is sharp\, fast-paced\, and
	 delivered with impeccable timing that comes from years of performing at t
	he highest levels of the industry. \nThis is a solo headlining show — a ra
	re opportunity to see one of LA’s most in-demand comedians in an intimate 
	San Antonio club setting. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering Jus
	tin for the first time\, you’re in for a fantastic Thursday night of comed
	y. \nGrab your tickets now before they sell out! \nTicket Information\n\nG
	eneral Admission: $20 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $30 (+ fees)\nOrder Lim
	it: 10 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post 
	contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets thr
	ough our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times 
	subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://co
	medycalendar.com/event/justin-martindale-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-clu
	b/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/justin-martindale-live-at-laugh-out-lo
	ud-comedy-club/
