	arodies of today’s biggest pop hits\nElaborate costume changes and theatri
	cal performances\nClassic fan-favorite songs spanning four decades\nOrigin
	al comedy songs and polka medleys\nA high-energy\, family-friendly comedy 
	concert experience\n\n\nVenue Information\nRuoff Music Center is one of In
	diana’s premier outdoor amphitheaters\, located at 12880 E. 146th St. in N
	oblesville\, IN. The venue features both covered pavilion seating and open
	 lawn areas\, offering a fantastic concert experience for all attendees. \
